# Neither combat-single-block-kills-attacker nor
# combat-single-block-kills-blocker covers an even trade: two vanilla
# Silvercoat Lions (2/2) block each other and both take exactly lethal
# damage -- both die to the same state-based-action check.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance
